# This package's own directory sits several levels below the monorepo
# root's .gitignore (which excludes *.wav there), and npm's default
# "fall back to .gitignore" behavior only looks at a .gitignore in this
# package's own directory -- so without this file, any WAV rendered locally
# into data/renders/ (scripts/render-track.mjs, render-improv-duo.mjs,
# render-arrangement.mjs, render-demos.mjs) would get swept into `npm
# publish`'s tarball. Renders are meant to be reproduced from the documented
# seed/command in each data/renders/*-note.md, not shipped as binary
# artifacts in the package itself.
*.wav
